WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.320
Hello everybody, how you doing?

00:00:01.320 --> 00:00:03.040
It's my wife, Frida, and myself,

00:00:03.040 --> 00:00:04.880
State Representative John Lujan,

00:00:04.880 --> 00:00:06.040
and we're here to vote today.

00:00:06.040 --> 00:00:07.200
We're at Southside High School.

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:09.240
This is where my boys graduated.

00:00:09.240 --> 00:00:11.920
Our family all knows this school district very well.

00:00:11.920 --> 00:00:14.720
We're here to vote, and I wanna tell everybody,

00:00:14.720 --> 00:00:17.800
we gotta keep our district in good hands,

00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:21.240
and our district in good hands would be Jorge Borrego.

00:00:21.240 --> 00:00:23.020
We've gotta get him in office.

00:00:23.020 --> 00:00:26.500
I know this is a very, very tough race,

00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:29.360
but we've gotta keep our momentum.

00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:31.880
Right now, I'm a state representative,

00:00:31.880 --> 00:00:33.200
and I've won the last two times,

00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:36.160
and we've got a lot of projects working, and I'm telling you,

00:00:36.160 --> 00:00:38.720
Jorge Borrego's gonna be the one to move those things

00:00:38.720 --> 00:00:41.680
and continue moving us in a positive direction.

00:00:41.680 --> 00:00:43.820
We don't wanna go backwards.

00:00:43.820 --> 00:00:45.420
I don't like talking bad about anybody,

00:00:45.420 --> 00:00:47.480
but Kristian Carranza's never had a job,

00:00:47.480 --> 00:00:50.880
never been in our community,

00:00:50.880 --> 00:00:52.640
hasn't worked in our community,

00:00:52.640 --> 00:00:56.000
and Jorge Borrego knows what to do in Austin,

00:00:56.000 --> 00:00:57.480
knows how to get things done,

00:00:57.480 --> 00:00:59.400
would be the best thing for our district.

00:00:59.400 --> 00:01:02.880
So I wanna encourage family, friends, people that have supported me in the past,

00:01:02.880 --> 00:01:04.480
please get out and vote,

00:01:04.480 --> 00:01:06.920
vote Jorge Borrego on the ballot,

00:01:06.920 --> 00:01:09.080
and let's keep things positive.

00:01:09.080 --> 00:01:10.200
Thank you very much.

